        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Corgan, Yelena Yemchuk\n- Bands: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- Albums: Adore\n- Songs: \"Perfect\", \"Crestfallen\", \"To Sheila\"\n- Topics: singles, promotional singles, artwork\n\nFacts:\n- The Smashing Pumpkins released \"Perfect\" as the final commercial single from their fourth album Adore.\n- After \"Perfect,\" The Smashing Pumpkins released two songs from Adore as promotional singles: \"Crestfallen\" and \"To Sheila.\"\n- Ukrainian photographer Yelena Yemchuk created the artwork for one of those promotional singles, \"Crestfallen.\"",
