        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: “Crestfallen,” “Perfect,” “To Sheila,” Adore\n- People: Yelena Yemchuk\n- Organizations: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- Roles: photographer, painter, film director\n\nFacts:\n- Yelena Yemchuk was born on April 22, 1970.\n- Yelena Yemchuk is a Ukrainian professional photographer, painter, and film director.\n- Yelena Yemchuk is best known for her work with The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- “Crestfallen” is a track on The Smashing Pumpkins’ 1998 album Adore.\n- The artwork for the single “Crestfallen” was created by Yelena Yemchuk.\n- “Perfect” was the final commercial single from Adore.\n- “Crestfallen” and “To Sheila” were subsequently released as promotional singles from Adore.",
